  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It would be nice to have an indicator that shows that the other player can, in fact, see your avatar. This could be be useful for a number of reason; you could know if someone has your avatar shown fully, or not.\n\nThat said, a far more important reason, IMO, for this to exist is avatar loading. For those of us who have slow Internet connections, it can be frustrating to have a group of people just bombard you with hi's and hello's and you have no idea what they're doing---are they hugging you? Flipping you the bird? Giving you a headpat? You only have a basic indicator of their arms. If those other players know \"oh, they're loading my avatar still\", it'd resolve a lot of minor social interactions issues.",
